2026-10-14T18:51:24.0591457Z       ✓ A03: Manager A CAN reset password of subordinate technician in Lab A; increments tokenVersion and returns random password (86 ms)
2026-10-14T18:51:24.0592217Z       ✓ A03: Viewer user cannot reset staff password (403 Forbidden) (7 ms)
2026-10-14T18:51:24.0592782Z     2. Lab Update Allowlist & Lifecycle Mutation Protection (A07, LG-02, LG-04, LG-05, A33)
2026-10-14T18:51:24.0593726Z       ✓ A07: Lab PUT rejects attempts to inject immutable fields (id, isActive, createdAt) (5 ms)
2026-10-14T18:51:24.0594275Z       ✓ A07: Lab PUT succeeds with allowlisted fields and does not alter immutable ID (6 ms)
2026-10-14T18:51:24.0594741Z       ✓ A01: Manager A cannot update Lab B via PUT (403 Forbidden) (4 ms)
2026-10-14T18:51:24.0595218Z       ✓ LG-04: Non-admin cannot create a laboratory via POST /api/labs (403 Forbidden) (4 ms)
2026-10-14T18:51:24.0595848Z       ✓ A33: Inactive lab technician can access /api/auth/me for read/history access with labIsActive=false (IR-10) (4 ms)
2026-10-14T18:51:24.0596435Z     3. User Administration, Last-Admin Protection & Validation (A08, A09, A10, LG-06, LG-07, LG-08)
