2026-10-14T18:51:24.0597478Z       ✓ LG-07: User creation rejects foreign labId for manager (403 Forbidden) (3 ms)
2026-10-14T18:51:24.0597901Z       ✓ LG-07: User update rejects empty string role (3 ms)
