2026-10-14T18:55:07.7812407Z       ✓ Self-role change is rejected with SELF_MANAGEMENT_FORBIDDEN
2026-10-14T18:55:07.7812950Z       ✓ Inactive actor is denied with ACTOR_INACTIVE
