2026-10-14T18:55:07.7814547Z       ✓ resolveProjectLabs correctly identifies owner and servicing laboratories (1 ms)
2026-10-14T18:55:07.7815415Z       ✓ getDiscrepancyReport scans database and returns audit report without data loss (3 ms)
2026-10-14T18:55:07.7816762Z       ✓ canManageProject allows owner lab manager and super admin; denies non-owner manager
