2026-10-14T18:55:07.7818131Z       ✓ Super Admin gets all 10 roles in assignableRoles (21 ms)
2026-10-14T18:55:07.7818980Z       ✓ Lab Manager gets only ALLOWED_SUB_ROLES and sees peer/admin roles as unmanageable with reasons (6 ms)
